schway-screen 1
screen help-palette-disabled
title Help disabled actions
description Unavailable keyboard actions stay searchable and the selected one names its reason.
variant dark-80
size 80x30
cursor 11 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project


  scripted/scripted-model · scripted API key

  Type a task · Enter sends












       Shift+Enter or Ctrl+J Insert a newline
       Ctrl+C                Copy selected text
   › ! F2 or Ctrl+I          Inspect details · No details to show · Esc back
     ! Esc or Ctrl+C         Cancel running work · Nothing running · Enter s…
       Shift+Tab             Change approval mode
       Alt+R                 Review changes
   ! No details to show · Esc back
